flowchart TB
    %% Comprehensive Data Preprocessing Flowchart
    
    Start([Start: Raw Data Collection]) --> DataSource["Data Sources<br/>- Job Market Data<br/>- Career Progression Records<br/>- Skills Database<br/>- Salary Information"]
    
    DataSource --> LoadData["Load Raw Dataset<br/>Format: CSV<br/>Initial Records: 20,000"]
    
    LoadData --> Inspect["Initial Data Inspection<br/>- Check dimensions<br/>- Identify data types<br/>- Detect missing values<br/>- Analyze distributions"]
    
    Inspect --> MissingCheck{Missing<br/>Values?}
    
    MissingCheck -->|Yes| HandleMissing["Handle Missing Data<br/>- Impute numerical (mean/median)<br/>- Impute categorical (mode)<br/>- Remove if > 50% missing"]
    MissingCheck -->|No| DuplicateCheck
    
    HandleMissing --> DuplicateCheck{Duplicate<br/>Records?}
    
    DuplicateCheck -->|Yes| RemoveDup["Remove Duplicates<br/>Keep first occurrence"]
    DuplicateCheck -->|No| Outliers
    
    RemoveDup --> Outliers["Outlier Detection<br/>- IQR method<br/>- Z-score analysis<br/>- Domain knowledge"]
    
    Outliers --> OutlierHandle{Handle<br/>Outliers?}
    
    OutlierHandle -->|Cap/Floor| CapOutliers["Cap at percentiles<br/>5th and 95th"]
    OutlierHandle -->|Remove| RemoveOutliers["Remove extreme values"]
    OutlierHandle -->|Keep| FeatureSep
    
    CapOutliers --> FeatureSep
    RemoveOutliers --> FeatureSep
    
    FeatureSep["Feature Separation<br/>- Numerical: 14 features<br/>- Categorical: 14 features<br/>- Target: Job roles (34 classes)"]
    
    FeatureSep --> NumericalPath["Numerical Processing"]
    FeatureSep --> CategoricalPath["Categorical Processing"]
    
    NumericalPath --> NumFeatures["Numerical Features:<br/>- Experience years<br/>- Education level<br/>- Salary expectations<br/>- Skill proficiency scores<br/>- Project counts<br/>- Certification counts"]
    
    NumFeatures --> Normalize["Normalization<br/>Standard Scaler<br/>z = (x - μ) / σ<br/>Mean = 0, Std = 1"]
    
    CategoricalPath --> CatFeatures["Categorical Features:<br/>- Current job role<br/>- Industry sector<br/>- Location<br/>- Education field<br/>- Key skills<br/>- Languages"]
    
    CatFeatures --> Encode["Encoding Strategy"]
    
    Encode --> OneHot["One-Hot Encoding<br/>Convert to binary vectors<br/>Result: 63 features"]
    
    Normalize --> Combine["Feature Integration<br/>Concatenate processed features<br/>Total dimensions: 77"]
    OneHot --> Combine
    
    Combine --> FeatureEng["Feature Engineering<br/>- Create interaction terms<br/>- Polynomial features (if needed)<br/>- Domain-specific features"]
    
    FeatureEng --> ClassBalance{Class<br/>Imbalance?}
    
    ClassBalance -->|Yes| Oversample["Random Oversampling<br/>Balance minority classes<br/>New total: 37,808 samples"]
    ClassBalance -->|No| DataSplit
    
    Oversample --> DataSplit["Train-Test Split<br/>Ratio: 80/20<br/>Stratified sampling<br/>Train: 30,246<br/>Test: 7,562"]
    
    DataSplit --> Validation["Create Validation Set<br/>From training data<br/>10% of training set"]
    
    Validation --> FinalCheck["Final Quality Check<br/>- Verify no data leakage<br/>- Check distributions<br/>- Validate shapes<br/>- Confirm no NaN values"]
    
    FinalCheck --> SaveData["Save Processed Data<br/>- Training set<br/>- Validation set<br/>- Test set<br/>- Scaler objects<br/>- Encoder mappings"]
    
    SaveData --> End([Data Ready for<br/>Model Training])
    
